1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Here's a problem with delegated agents.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,000
An agent can stay within its own spending limit

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,500
and still spend money it has already promised to someone else.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,500
Watch.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
The owner gives Agent A one NEAR.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
A reserves point four for B.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
B reserves point one five for C.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Every allocation must fit inside the original boundary.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Agents can delegate authority.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
They cannot multiply it.

11
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Now A tries to spend point six one.

12
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,000
It looks like A has enough.

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
But point four is already committed to B.

14
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Only zero point six zero is available.

15
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,500
Blocked.

16
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,500
BUDGET_RESERVATION.

17
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:47,000
No funds moved.

18
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Then B tries point two six.

19
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,500
Same problem, one level down.

20
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:00,000
Point one five is already promised to C.

21
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,500
Only zero point two five is available.

22
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,500
Blocked again.

23
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:06,500
BUDGET_RESERVATION.

24
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:09,000
The restriction applies at every level.

25
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,500
Now the valid path.

26
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:15,000
A spends point six zero.

27
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
B spends point two five.

28
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,000
C spends point one five.

29
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Exactly one NEAR.

30
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:23,500
All three transfers settle.

31
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:26,000
And the recipient's balance confirms it.

32
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Recorded on NEAR testnet.

33
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,500
Not simulated.

34
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Then the owner revokes A.

35
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,000
B tries again.

36
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,500
REVOKED.

37
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:50,000
C tries again.

38
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,500
REVOKED.

39
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:55,000
Neither can use authority that no longer exists.

40
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,000
One action at the root.

41
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,000
The chain stops at its source.

42
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,000
The vault rejects an overgrant.

43
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Scoped agent keys cannot take owner-level actions.

44
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Three attempts rejected.

45
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,500
Every result is recorded on NEAR testnet.

46
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:14,000
Independently verified twenty-five checks, all passing.

47
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,500
INTENTRA.

48
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:18,000
Authority can be delegated.

49
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,000
It cannot multiply.
